Subject: [PATCH] Settings: use ExpressiveOS's mark for the customization hub
 icon

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the hub entry on the Settings homepage
showed Evolution X's logo. Draw the four petals of the ExpressiveOS mark
instead, keeping each icon's colour and tint.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
